{"title":"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What  is  the  remainder  when  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/4/f64cc7e0ee08af7c8ac16f640cc716430af894e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{2006}$\" width=\"34\" height=\"15\" />  is  divided  by  7?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/3/0f35351750b299651f07a3339606240637068649.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\,0\\quad\\mathrm{(B)}\\,1\\quad\\mathrm{(C)}\\,2\\quad\\mathrm{(D)}\\,3\\quad\\mathrm{(E)}\\,4\\quad\\mathrm{(F)}\\,5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"318\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/1/591d9b115cf384bfadec71afd7ffa4397726d79a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^3 = 8$\" width=\"49\" height=\"15\" />, and the remainder when divided by 7 is 1.  In other words, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/3/433935c5133838eb146dc1aa373291a25f6d01ff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^3 \\equiv 1 \\pmod{7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"120\" height=\"19\" />.  Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/9/4a9474f47b4af70527c910fcb8def5e6600f0a86.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{3n} \\equiv (2^3)^n \\equiv 1^n \\equiv 1 \\pmod{7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"238\" height=\"21\" />.\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/e/a3e8bae1f24d0bc98ce59b6c4a3f14990f1b4dc0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2006 = 3 \\cdot 668 + 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"143\" height=\"15\" />, we find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/4/7541afa85e5d997d8f1e485377ce3d836ff6b442.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{2006} \\equiv 2^2 \\equiv 4 \\pmod{7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"181\" height=\"19\" />, so the remainder when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/4/f64cc7e0ee08af7c8ac16f640cc716430af894e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{2006}$\" width=\"34\" height=\"15\" /> gets divided by 7 is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/d/cbd606e4d98385629ad40b24dcd123033160ff87.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E) } 4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"54\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By Fermat's Little Theorem we have that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/c/6bcccd3de1dccea5a3a52fcb16dbebe2d87b50f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^6 \\equiv 1 \\pmod 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"124\" height=\"21\" />. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/f/bafc57cd4019e479e2575c03d1f00a17dfe1698a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{2004} \\equiv 1 \\pmod 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"144\" height=\"21\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/5/a95e4b7c5539e75ddcd86f8c82506c848cadb2ed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{2006} \\equiv \\boxed{4} \\pmod 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"155\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>~Pinotation\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest\" title=\"2006 iTest\">2006 iTest</a> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems\">(Problems</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2006 iTest Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key)</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iT